== Trivia ==
*'''Dirt Guy''' could be a reference to [[fandom:spiderman-films:Sandman_(Thomas_Haden_Church)|Sandman]] from several ''[[w:Spiderman|Spider-Man]]'' films.
*'''Dirt Guy'''<nowiki>'</nowiki>s line of dialogue 'PRECIOUS!' is a reference to [[w:Gollum|Gollum]] from J.R.R. Tolkien's [[w:The Lord of the Rings|''The Lord of the Rings'']].
*Upon interaction, a dirt placing sound will play.
*There is a {{Item|Fairy Soul}} inside the cave he is at, which is located at {{Coordinates|22|127|184}}. 
*When given an {{Item|InfiniDirt™ Wand}} whilst the {{NPCSprite|Tyashoi Alchemist}} is in the [[Village]], he will give the player a {{Item|Precious}} and take their {{Item|InfiniDirt™ Wand}}.

